      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{58c62e995865713647a7115b|full_name}: Here is an example world.  wrld_848078be-e655-4223-82b1-aad36ffae902\nWalk into one of the balls to teleport normally to the destination in the boxed area.  Pick up a ball and allow it to hit the player and you can see the avatar image glitch to the boxed area and then pop right back.  Thanks!",
