  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I've setup a moving object as a trigger that teleports the player after \"OnAvatarHit\".  The teleport works properly if the player is moving by pressing a move direction. However, if the player is still and gets hit by the moving teleporter object then only the image of the avatar teleports for a couple seconds and the player's camera doesn't follow.  The avatar image quickly snaps back to where the player camera is located. \n\nThanks in advance for any help with this issue!",
